# Secrets — contact.local.php

- **Never commit** `contact.local.php` (or any file containing real SMTP passwords).
- Only `public/contact.local.php.example` may be tracked; it must keep the placeholder `BURAYA-MAIL-SIFRESI`.
- Real credentials go only on the Plesk/web root as `contact.local.php`, next to `contact.php`.
- If a password appears in a tracked file, remove it before commit and restore the placeholder.
- Do not put secrets in `.example` files, PR descriptions, commit messages, or chat summaries.
